               <title>Package/Label principal display panel </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>amazon basics</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Compare to Robitussin® Maximum Strength Severe Multi-Symptom Cough Cold + Flu active ingredients</paragraph>
